<p>Factfile:</p>
<p>Borussia Dortmund's Lothar Emmerich is one of only three</p>
<p>players to have scored six goals in a European club match. They</p>
<p>came in an 8-0 win over Floriana Valletta of Malta in a Cup</p>
<p>Winners Cup match in 1965.</p>
<p>Manchester United were unbeaten at home in 40 years and 55</p>
<p>matches until their 1-0 defeat to Fenerbahce of Turkey in this</p>
<p>season's Champions League. They then lost their next match 1-0</p>
<p>at home to Juventus.</p>
